        "If the formula gives a wrong answer: double check I'm taking the max with len(tasks), and that max_count correctly counts ALL tied tasks, not just one.",
        "If the interviewer asks for a simulation instead: pivot to a heap-based approach that greedily always schedules the currently most frequent available task.",
